Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:13.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}U-Ulteriore rapporto dall'ingresso principale!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E ora che c'è?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:24.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Un gruppo sospetto a bordo di mostri hanno superato \Nla ringhiera di ferro e stanno facendo irruzione!{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chiediamo dei rinforzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:31.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dei rinforzi...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Che succede?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:43.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guardiano!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rispondimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cosa sta succedendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Che succede, Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non fermarti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Voialtri, siete pronti?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come vanno le ferite?{idk, gli chiede di ferite}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sto bene poiché...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,io sono Sogeking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Il treno marino Rocketman farà \Nirruzione tra quattro minuti!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scusatemi, potreste spostarsi da lì?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anche se lo chiedi educatamente...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quando è no...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,rimane no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ho capito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allora...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Preparatevi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maledetto pirata!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Robot Alleato!{G - abilità [Luffy]}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Woah! Che sleale!{ew}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non possiamo attaccare!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non fatevi intimidire da tali...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bambinate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Robot Alleato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Punch!{G - abilità [Luffy]}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:53.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Robot Alleato Kick!{G - abilità [Luffy]}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:57.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mi dispiace, collega!{senpai T_T come immagino sappiate non è solo collega, è un collega più anziano di se stesso, ma non necessariamente un superiore}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Falla finita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:02.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hai la schiena tutta scoperta!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fatelo fuori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È disarmato e da solo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cos'è quella leggerezza?!{leggerenza di corpo... probabilmente nel senso che è agile idk}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Io devo sbrigarmi ad andare avanti!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poi arriverà altra gente!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:05:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, asp–! Fermo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È entrato! \NSbrighiamoci a rientrare dal cancello!{ew. sarebbe tipo sbrighiamoci ad andare nella parte interna del cancello}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È entrato nell'isola!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Messaggio dal cancello principale\N al comandante!{messaggio l'ho aggiunto, ma cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}L-Luffy Cappello di Paglia è riuscito \Ndavvero a fare irruzione!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cosa?! \NL'avete lasciato entrare nell'isola?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ma che sta succedendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dove sono Oimo e Kashii?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sono stati sconfitti anche quei due?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, ma dato che al momento è notte fonda,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}probabilmente stanno dormendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ma gli pare il momento di dormire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Svegliateli subito!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vale anche per tutti i \Nsoldati che stanno dormendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sì!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Serve davvero
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,urlare così tanto per un\N semplice intruso, Comandante?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ci siamo qui noi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non dire idiozie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:07:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Questo posto è l'ingresso del Governo Mondiale \Ne porta il badge di isola giudiziaria!{lo so che è orrendo}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Qualunque idiota dovrebbe riuscire a capire cosa \Nsignifichi se un intruso riesce a irromperci!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:13.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Il fatto che sia riuscito ad entrare nell'isola \Nper recuperare una sola compagna è...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:16.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,vergognoso! Che sfrontato!{ew}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quel maledetto di Cappello \Ndi Paglia e la sua ciurma...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guardiano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:25.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spiegami la situazione all'ingresso principale!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.05,0:07:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehi, guardiano!{G - varie solo per non dimenticarmi}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quanti sono i nemici?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dove si trovano al momento?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rispondetemi, ingresso principale!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ehi, che succede?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rispondimi, guardiano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rope Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:47.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Figure of Eight Knot!{G - abilità [Paulie]}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bazooka Bat!{G - abilità [Zambai]}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usare i proiettili sarebbe uno spreco!{sarebbe ancora uno spreco, nel senso che al momento lo sarebbe, poi non è detto}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Entrate dalla porta sul lato! Aprite il cancello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non ve lo lascerò aprire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sei in mezzo!\N– Sei in mezzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mozu! A sinistra!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:13.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non vi lascerò passare!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:15.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Woah! Un ciuffo ribelle dal naso!{ciuffo tipo di quelli da appena svegli, quelli del tizio della galley-la di cui mi sfugge il nome al momento}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:17.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È vietato distogliere lo sguardo!{ew cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sbrigatevi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grazie!{direbbe scusa, ma si intende grazie}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:32.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spezzachiglia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non ce l'avete ancora fatta, Mozu, Kiwi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Una chiave del genere \Nper i demolitori della famiglia Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È aperto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anche questo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.89,0:08:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bene! Aprite i cancelli! Destroyers Sovrumani!{meh circa... non so poi se "kairiki" vuol essere parte del nomignolo o meno, destroyer di sicuro però. G personaggi}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non lasciateglieli aprire!\N Difendeteli ad ogni costo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spostati, sei d'intralcio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Avanti tutti!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:35.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Primo cancello principale superato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:41.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Woah! Cos'è 'sto buco?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non c'è tempo! Non distraetevi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Procedete!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Correte verso il cancello principale dell'isola!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È una cascata!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evviva!\N– Evviva!{ce l'abbiamo fatta}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehi, voialtri! Di qua!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:10:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Datemi una mano, veloci!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Signor Kashii! Signor Oimo! \NSvegliatevi in fretta, vi prego!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}D-Degli intrusi hanno aperto l'ingresso principale!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dicono che l'ingresso principale \Nsia stato aperto, Oimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Già...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non va proprio bene, Kashii.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Da appena sveglio è dura, ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,è lavoro. Andiamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Oplà!\N– Oplà!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Eeeeh!\N– Eeeeh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Non ho dormito abbastanza...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:04.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mandiamoli via in fretta e torniamo a dormire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Infatti.{tipo "anch'io", ma tizio qua usa "oimo" per riferirsi a se stesso, ma non è proprio il suo nome. Oimo nome è scritto tutto in katakata, il suo modo di dire io invece è oi in katakana + mo in hiragana}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:08.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-D-Dei giganti?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Voialtri... \Nnon so cosa siate venuti a fare qui,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ma fareste meglio ad andarvene \Nprima di essere schiacciati.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vero, Oimo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Già, Kashii. Sono d'accordo anch'io.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:24.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi ridurremmo in poltiglia fino al midollo!{ew}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dei guardiani della razza dei giganti...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,non è contro le regole?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sono enormi... I Destroyers Sovrumani \Nsembrano teneri in confronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forza, andatevene!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non passerete per questo cancello!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Infatti!{idem a prima}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arrivano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non importa chi sia il nemico, \Nnon fatevi intimorire, famiglia Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È per il fratello!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sì!\N– Sì!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehi... Avete capito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:56.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sì...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bene...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:05.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,È ovvio che tocchi a noi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Non abbiamo nulla da invidiare a dei giganti con la forza\Nsviluppata grazie alle demolizioni!{ew}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Destroyers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I tre Destroyers Sovrumani...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In un batter d'occhio...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siamo la razza guerriera sin dalla nascita!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Il nostro sangue è ben diverso da \Ndegli umani leggermente più grandi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non lasceremo passare nessuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Infatti!{same come sopra}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Non tiratevi indietro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:01.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non scoraggiatevi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Infatti! Il fratello Franky è oltre quel cancello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mostriamogli un combattimento degno \Ndel nome del nostro fratello, famiglia Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehi! Luffy Cappello di Paglia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quanti compagni hai portato con te?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I soldati di Enies Lobby sono diecimila!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ok. Io sono da solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fatemi passare!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{13:07}Mostriamogli un combattimento degno \Ndel nome del nostro fratello, famiglia Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:58.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non arrendetevi!{ non perdete}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dobbiamo fare strada per il Rocketman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sfondate il cancello!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Da questo cancello non passerà \Nnemmeno una formica!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Destroyers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ragazzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maledizione! Persino le nostre \Nprincipali forze d'attacco...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cosa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:43.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zambai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiwi! Mozu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scusate, siamo arrivati tardi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ci abbiamo messo un po' per attrezzare \NSodoma e Gomorra per la terraferma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zambai! I Destroyers...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lo so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non possiamo soccorrerli ora!{non c'è tempo per soccorrerli ora}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dobbiamo assolutamente aprire questo \Ncancello per raggiungere il fratello!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Andiamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sì!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Facciamogli perdere l'equilibrio, Mozu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger, Kiwi!{...io lo so che me lo cambi}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}– Fendente Demolitore della Carena!\N– Fendente Demolitore della Carena!{G - abilità [Kiwi & Mozu]}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rope Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Timber Hitch Tug!{G - abilità [Paulie]}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahi, ahi, ahi, ahi, ahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashii!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:15:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tilestone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:01.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sì!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cosa?! Ahi, ahi, ahi, ahi!{una guess più che altro, pure dal jp perché i sub non ce l'avevano}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Trunnel Lock!{G - abilità [Tilestone]}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lavoro completato!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brutti...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.93,0:16:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi schiaccerò!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.73,0:16:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashii!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastardi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:00.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uomini! Andiamo con l'altro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sì!\N– Sì!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E poi cos'è successo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sì! Al momento, Kashii e Oimo dovrebbero \Nessersi diretti verso il cancello principale,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}perciò non credo ci saranno problemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Avete catturato Cappello di Paglia?{direbbe anche "che ha fatto irruzione sull'isola", ma mi pare tanto ridondante}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ecco, eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}È solo una stima, \Nma penso che siamo sui quattrocento.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quattrocento?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Di che stai parlando?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}È l'entità delle perdite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah?! L'entità dei danni?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.25,0:17:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vuoi dire che quattrocento \Nguardie sono stati sconfitti?!{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Pare che siano aumentati di un altro centinaio...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, no, chiedo scusa. Mi correggo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mi pare ovvio! Le guardie non \Nsono mica spazzatura qui!{meh circa}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Figurati se sono stati sconfitti così tanti!{ew cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.27,0:18:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se ci sono delle perdite, \Ndimmele correttamente!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh, allora le farò rapporto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Al momento, le perdite ammontano a cinque–{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,persone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cinque persone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quindi erano solo cinque?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Che cavolo... \NNon sai neanche fare rapporto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cinque... cento pers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pare che Cappello di Paglia stia scappando \Ndentro l'isola senza combattere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beh, mi sembra ovvio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nessuno è così idiota da avventarsi \Ncontro così tante guardie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}La sua cattura ormai è solo questione di tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ottimo lavoro.{ew}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Comandante! \NIl gruppo del signor Lucci è arrivato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sono tornati, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fateli passare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.99,0:18:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehi, Sogeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,La mia schiena... Che male! Ehi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Riguardo l'uso di questo Tact per l'aria gelida...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah? Vediamo, vediamo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Non chiedere a me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bene, voialtri! È giunto il momento!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Direi che è ora di avviarci, no?{ew}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dovrebbero avere aperto i due cancelli!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assalto! Assalto!
Comment: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:23.39,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:24.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai-man! Lascio la ringhiera \Ndi ferro nelle tue mani!{samurai-man tipo spider-man direi, col trattino}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lascia fare a me.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=11}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=34}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
